{"legislative_session": "2026RS", "identifier": "HB281", "title": "AN ACT relating to the donation of food.", "from_organization": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["bill"], "subject": ["Agriculture", "Civil Actions", "Claims", "Licensing", "Public Health", "Religion", "State Agencies"], "abstracts": [{"note": "Summary of Original Version", "abstract": "Amend KRS 217.127 to define \"charitable food donor\" as a nonprofit or religious organization that is recognized as tax exempt under Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code or home-based processor, which produces food for distribution to a homeless shelter or to individuals displaced due to a declared natural disaster; exempt a charitable food donor from the licensing requirements of KRS 217.005 to 217.215 and application of State Plumbing Code requirements; amend KRS 217.218 to conform; amend KRS 411.241 to exempt a nonprofit or religious organization that is recognized as tax exempt under Section 501(c)(3) of the Internal Revenue Code or a home-based processor from civil or criminal liability arising from the production or donation of food to a homeless shelter or to individuals displaced due to a declared natural disaster."}], "other_titles": [], "other_identifiers": [{"identifier": "ocd-bill-ky-2026rs-hb281"}], "actions": [{"description": "introduced in House", "date": "2026-01-08T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["introduction"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "to Committee on Committees (H)", "date": "2026-01-08T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "to Agriculture (H)", "date": "2026-01-15T05:00:00+00:00", "organization_id": "~{\"classification\": \"lower\"}", "classification": ["referral-committee"], "related_entities": []}, {"description": "reported favorably, 1st reading, to Calendar", "date": "202